+    // reach ~6-12 rad/s^2 gyro slew per step), so the propagated attitude was
+    // systematically wrong under motion: ~2 deg / 12 cm correction fight every
+    // 100 ms scan, spiraling to full divergence in ~15 s. Static sessions were
+    // unaffected (constant gyro -> limiter inert), which is why every saved map
+    // so far was static-only. ESKF process noise (cov_gyr_/cov_acc_) is the
+    // correct noise handling; raw IMU goes straight into prediction/undistort.
